# Documentation

- With every repository change, check affected `docs/` pages and update them in the same commit when the implemented state changes.
- Do not put plans, unimplemented contracts, history, or migration narratives in `docs/`.
- Do not fill an empty `docs/` page until its subject exists and has been verified against the repository.
- Keep each fact in one primary document; use links instead of duplicate descriptions. Keep indexes and relevant README files accurate.
